model under test: wdog1 (Timers.MPFS_Watchdog @ 0x20101000) — the model SOURCE IS NOT SHIPPED in the image and no
  version-bound upstream source is obtainable (renode-infrastructure exposes no release ref for build
  d66b0c2a-202602160923), so every model statement is a MEASURED observation.

REGISTER MAP (from the cited public header, mss_watchdog.h: WATCHDOG_TypeDef):
  0x00 REFRESH | 0x04 CONTROL | 0x08 STATUS | 0x0c TIME | 0x10 MSVP | 0x14 TRIGGER | 0x18 FORCE
  -> the probe script's LABELS for 0x08 ('TIME') and 0x04 ('STATUS') were WRONG: 0x08 is STATUS and
     0x04 is CONTROL; the TIME register (0x0c) was never probed. See the correction note at the end.

scope of this probe (important):
  - monitor-driven register writes; NO SUT ELF loaded; the machine was NOT started;
  - the counter was therefore not running and the read-backs are register-level, not timing;
  - REFRESH (0x00) was written but never read back, so no counter value was observed.

--- probe script (exact, as executed) ---
mach create "wdprobe"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/beaglev-fire.repl
echo "=== A. initial register state (wdog1 @ 0x20101000) ==="
echo "TIME(0x08):"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20101008
echo "STATUS(0x04):"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20101004
echo "=== B. configure in the documented order: TRIGGER, MSVP, TIME ==="
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x20101014 0x64
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x20101010 0x32
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x20101008 0xC8
echo "TIME readback after configure:"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20101008
echo "STATUS readback after configure:"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20101004
echo "=== C. REFRESH with a WRONG key (0x1) ==="
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x20101000 0x1
echo "TIME readback after wrong-key refresh:"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20101008
echo "STATUS readback after wrong-key refresh:"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20101004
echo "=== D. REFRESH with the documented key (0xDEADC0DE) ==="
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x20101000 0xDEADC0DE
echo "TIME readback after correct-key refresh:"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20101008
echo "STATUS readback after correct-key refresh:"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20101004
echo "=== E. lock probe: re-write TIME and TRIGGER after configuration ==="
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x20101008 0x3C
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x20101014 0x0A
echo "TIME readback after re-write:"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20101008
echo "TRIGGER readback after re-write:"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20101014
echo "=== F. bound probe: write TIME=0x1000000 (24-bit field) and TRIGGER=0x1000 (12-bit) ==="
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x20101008 0x1000000
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x20101014 0x1000
echo "TIME readback:"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20101008
echo "TRIGGER readback:"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x20101014
echo "=== G. reset macro / machine reset availability ==="
echo "sysbus machine list:"
machine
echo "=== end of probe ==="
quit

